 singles: la banda funk sustancial de los setenta había desaparecido.","color":"#22d3ee","family":"Funk de los ochenta: Prince, Rick James, electro","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/Funk/#bandas-naked"}],"book_tracks":[],"mentions":[],"podcast":[{"kind":"podcast","title":"Noted Exception in \"Depressed\" Rock Scene","body":"In his review of Elton John's 1970 debut, Los Angeles Times critic Robert Hilburn noted that the rock scene had been \"rather depressed lately,\" with Leon Russell being one of the few exceptions providing artistic substance amidst a period of \"electronic noise\" and \"million sellers.\" \"The fact is the rock scene has been rather depressed lately, except for the band, Credence Clearwater Revival, Joe Cocker and Leon Russell.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"For the Record - The 70s","episode":"Ep. 41 - The Impact of The Troubadour on 1970s Popular Culture","url":null},{"source":"For the Record - The 70s","episode":"Ep. 41 - The Impact of The Troubadour on 1970s Popular Culture","url":"https://seventies.libsyn.com/ep-41-the-impact-of-the-troubadour-on-1970s-popular-culture"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Recognized Piano Player","body":"Leon Russell is acknowledged as a significant piano player in the rock landscape. He is mentioned among a list of notable musicians who contributed to piano-driven music across various genres. \"And there are others, Leon Russell Mike Garcin, who played with Boie for years.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"Piano Heroes","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dJiSZ4X0F2g"}]}],"awards":[{"kind":"award","title":"Oklahoma Music Hall of Fame (2006)","body":"Won.","year":2006,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Wikidata","episode":null,"url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q7082270"}]},{"kind":"award","title":"Rock and Roll Hall of Fame (2011)","body":"Won.","year":2011,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Wikidata","episode":null,"url":"https://www.wiki